      "Maps class hierarchies, inheritance chains, and property-to-class relationships.",
      "Finds orphaned items, duplicate identifiers, missing fields, and broken references.",
      "Compares template variants and identifies included, excluded, or variant-specific elements.",
      "Reports module sizes, balance, and growth with actionable recommendations."
    ],
    "limitations": [
